# Retail POS module map

| Domain | API prefix | Models |
|--------|------------|--------|
| Auth / SSO | `app/api/auth/` (`login`, `sso/exchange`, `me`, `session/refresh-permissions`) | `User`, `Role` |
| Access matrix (RET-RBAC-01) | `app/api/admin/roles`, `admin/roles/[code]`, `admin/roles/[code]/permissions`, `api/internal/v1/workforce/roles`, `admin/users`, `admin/user-logins`, `auth/logout`; pages `/settings/users`, `/admin/access`, `/settings/logins` (nav Hesablar) | `Role`, `User` (`cpEmploymentId`), `UserLogin`; catalog `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`; role code+name pushed to CP |
| Staff provision | `POST /api/integration/staff-provision` | CP `STAFF_PROVISIONED` / `STAFF_DEACTIVATED` for `industry_retail` |
| Receipts / pay | `app/api/receipts/` | `Receipt`, lines, fiscal, room charge. Revenue key is the product, then `ProductCategory`, then the outlet |
| Prescription queue | `POST /api/integration/prescription-queue` (service token), `POST /api/integration/prescription-queue/[id]` (`api:receipts.sell`) | `paid` posts the folio or hotel cashier line (price, SKU, revenue code). `dispense` rings the receipt. `return` moves the money back only after the goods are accepted |
| Open shifts for hotel | `GET /api/internal/v1/shifts/open` | Night audit polls the hub organization |
| Hotel settlement callback | `POST /api/integration/settlement-confirmed` | Walk-in `PENDING_HUB` → `PAID` and one sale event |
| Revenue codes | `/admin/catalog`, `GET /api/admin/hotel-revenue-codes`, `/api/admin/outlets`, `/api/admin/product-categories` | `api:hotel.revenue_codes`. Outlet and category pickers; outlet phone/email/address/website for receipt chrome overlay. Pay `POST /api/receipts/[id]/pay` returns `printChrome` (CP orgProfile + outlet — CP-ORG-PROFILE-01 Track C). A code on the product is not used |
| Shifts | `app/api/shifts/` | open pulls RETAIL channel prices into the product journal; close, X-report |
| Products / stock | `products/`, `stock/`, `/api/import` (`stock-cards`) | search, check, replenishment; Nafta `#33` cutover wizard `/admin/import` |
| Integrations | `integrations/marketplace`, `integration/` | prescription, stock write-off |
| Offline | `offline/sync` | edge replay |
| Events | `events/dispatch` | sale completed → orchestrator |
| Internal | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind`, `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` | Orch Sync bind + desired-state config; `instrumentation` boot |

Room charge when `shouldRouteRevenueToParent`; fiscal via `fiscalizeForSatellite`. Selling prices append to `ProductPrice`.

**SaaS Wave 3 request tenant:** staff login/SSO JWT `organizationId`; middleware `x-era-organization-id`; `getSatelliteSession()` (token org, active user, `requireRetailSatellite(org)`; one call per handler inside `try`); ops stamps via `requestOrganizationId()`. AC-RET-TENANT stays 🟡 — not sellable SHARED pool.

**RBAC Variant A (RET-RBAC-01):** `getSatelliteSession()` also builds `permissions` from the role row and checks the stamped API path against `api-route-permissions.ts` (unlisted → 403). Pages: middleware `authorizePage` + `page-route-permissions.ts`. A new staff route or page needs a catalog row in the same change. ADR retail-domain-permissions-and-rbac.

## Platform billing status

`GET /api/platform/billing-status` — `app/api/platform/billing-status/route.ts` re-exports `@era/satellite-kit/billing/status-route` (banner in `EraAppRouteShell`). Staff calls the orchestrator denies (SOFT_BLOCK export, HARD_BLOCK write) get 402 from kit `readSatelliteStaffSession`; `handleRouteError` returns `{ error, code, billingStatus }`. ADR `docs/adr/billing-enforcement-satellites.md`.
